  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Boil the kettle.\n• Slice red onion into wedges.\n• Cut pumpkin into 1cm-thick wedges.\n• Place onion and pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over paprika spice blend, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b52fbcb653703ca93c6e/step-fff15b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine hummus, everything garnish and a good squeeze of lemon juice. Set aside.\n• When pumpkin has 10 minutes remaining, in a medium heatproof bowl, add couscous and stock concentrate.\n• Add the boiling water (see ingredients) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b52fbcb653703ca93c6e/step-0c9e0b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Set your air fryer to 200°C.\n• Place spinach falafel in air fryer basket. Brush or spray with a drizzle of olive oil and bake until golden and heated through, 5-6 minutes.\n• TIP: No air fryer? In a large frying pan, heat olive oil (1 tbsp per person) over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook spinach falafel, tossing, until deep golden brown, 4-6 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b52fbcb653703ca93c6e/step-1b555e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous and roasted veggies between bowls. Top with spinach falafel.\n• Crumble over smooth fetta and tear over parsley.\n• Dollop with zesty hummus and Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients). Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b52fbcb653703ca93c6e/step-4fdb6030.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
